  "problem": "Which expression is equivalent to $(M\u2227N)\u2228R?$",
  "worked_solution": "By the commutative law, $M\u2227N\u2261N\u2227M.$\n\nTherefore, $(M\u2227N)\u2228R\u2261(N\u2227M)\u2228R.$\n\nFinally, by the commutative law, we have\n\n$$\n(N\u2227M)\u2228R\u2261R\u2228(N\u2227M).\n$$",
